{"ref":"BDB, יְהוּדִית","hw":"יְהוּדִית","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוּדִית</span></big>  <strong>adj.gent., f.</strong> of foregoing, but only as <strong>adv. in Jewish</strong> = <em>in the Jewish language</em> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:26\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.26\">2 K 18:26</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:28\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.28\">28</a> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.36.11\">Is 36:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.36.13\">13</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 32:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.32.18\">2 Ch 32:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:24\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.24\">Ne 13:24</a>.","next":"BDB, יְהוּדִי²","prev":"BDB, יְהוּדִי"}